{"lang":"zh","dir":"ltr","text":{"credits.donateTitle":"帮助学习保持免费","credits.donateButton":"支持 AOSSIE","credits.data":"数据","credits.photos":"首都照片","credits.otherPhotos":"水果、动物和矿物的照片","madeBy":"出品"},"html":{"credits.lead":"Memo 是由 <a href=\"https://aossie.org/\">AOSSIE</a> 开发的免费开源软件。","credits.source":"源代码：<a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame\">github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame</a>。","credits.donateText":"AOSSIE 是一个非营利组织。Memo 没有广告、没有订阅，也从不收集你的数据——我们希望让世界各地的每个孩子都能一直这样使用它。如果 Memo 让你的孩子对世界产生了好奇，欢迎请我们喝杯咖啡：每一笔捐款，无论多少，都能帮助我们开发和维护更多免费的教育应用。我们同样欢迎你贡献代码、想法、翻译和反馈！","credits.shapes":"形状图片：专为 Memo 绘制，和本应用的其他部分一样可以免费使用。","credits.photoSets":"水果、动物和矿物的照片：来自 <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>，通过 <a href=\"https://www.wikipedia.org/\">Wikipedia</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a> 选出；它们在各种语言中的名称：<a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a>（CC0）。","credits.flags":"国旗：来自 <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>，其国旗取自 <a href=\"https://github.com/hampusborgos/country-flags\">hampusborgos/country-flags</a>（公有领域）。","credits.capitals":"首都及其照片：来自 <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>，其数据取自 <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a>（CC0）和 <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>。","credits.names":"国家名称的其他语言版本：<a href=\"https://cldr.unicode.org/\">Unicode CLDR</a>（<a href=\"https://www.unicode.org/license.txt\">Unicode License v3</a>）；首都名称：<a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a>（CC0）。","credits.photosNote":"所有照片均来自 <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>，经过缩放和裁剪。点击链接可查看原图和完整的许可条款。"},"capitals":{"AD":"安道尔城","AE":"阿布扎比","AF":"喀布尔","AG":"圣约翰","AL":"地拉那","AM":"埃里温","AO":"罗安达","AR":"布宜诺斯艾利斯","AS":"帕果帕果","AT":"维也纳","AU":"堪培拉","AW":"奥腊涅斯塔德","AX":"玛丽港","AZ":"巴库","BA":"萨拉热窝","BB":"布里奇顿","BD":"达卡","BE":"布鲁塞尔","BF":"瓦加杜古","BG":"索非亚","BH":"麦纳麦","BI":"基特加","BJ":"波多诺伏","BM":"哈密尔顿","BN":"斯里巴加湾","BO":"苏克雷